Package: capemlVector
Title: Tools for Generating EML Metadata for Spatial Vector Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("S", "Earl", email = "stevan.earl@asu.edu",
  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Facilitates the creation of Ecological Metadata Language (EML)
  spatialVector entities from spatial data objects for publishing to the
  Environmental Data Initiative (EDI) data repository. Functions support
  creating metadata for vector files (KML, GeoJSON, and ESRI shapefiles) and
  generating EML geographic coverage elements from simple features objects.
  Intended as a companion to the capeml package, which handles tabular data
  and dataset-level metadata.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
License: CC0
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
